const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"同一种资产，为什么出现不同价格？",en:"Why can the same asset have different prices?"},body:{zh:"Makarov与Schoar把不同交易所的比特币价格放在一起，研究价格偏离为何反复出现、为何没有立即消失。重点是市场之间的连接与资金约束，而不是单个交易所的价格趋势。",en:"Makarov and Schoar compare bitcoin prices across exchanges to study recurring deviations and why they persist. The focus is connections between markets and constraints on capital, rather than a price trend within one venue."}},{title:{zh:"原始观测是带场所身份的成交",en:"The observations are venue-specific trades"},body:{zh:"接受稿第2节说明主要资料来自Kaiko，覆盖17家大型交易所，分析窗口为2017年1月1日至2018年2月28日。记录包含成交时间、价格、数量和买卖发起方向。它不是把几家网站的日收盘价拼在一起；场所、报价币和时钟对齐共同决定比较是否有意义。",en:"Section 2 of the accepted manuscript describes Kaiko trades from 17 large exchanges, focusing on January 1, 2017–February 28, 2018. Fields include timestamps, prices, amounts and initiation direction. This is not a panel of website daily closes: venue identity, quote currency and synchronized clocks jointly define a meaningful comparison."},reference:{url:"https://researchonline.lse.ac.uk/id/eprint/100409/1/Cryptocurrency_Markets_JFE_final_v4.pdf",label:{zh:"接受稿第2节：数据描述",en:"Accepted manuscript §2: data description"}}},{title:{zh:"跨场所比较需要统一什么？",en:"What must a venue comparison align?"},body:{zh:"研究使用多个国家、多个交易所的逐笔数据，比较境内与跨国价差，并区分共同和场所特有的带方向成交量变化。报价币种、时间同步与场所身份都是比较的前提，不能在聚合时消失。",en:"The analysis uses tick data across countries and exchanges, compares domestic with international deviations, and distinguishes common from venue-specific signed-volume components. Quote currencies, synchronized time and venue identity are prerequisites, not disposable metadata."}},{title:{zh:"价格偏离揭示市场分割",en:"Deviations reveal segmentation"},body:{zh:"作者报告跨国价格偏离通常比同国内更大，在比特币快速升值时期共同扩大，并讨论跨境资本流动约束的作用。这些证据说明看到价差并不等于资金能够无摩擦地跨场所移动。",en:"The paper reports larger deviations across countries than within them, common widening during rapid bitcoin appreciation, and a role for constraints on cross-border capital. Seeing a spread is not equivalent to being able to move capital frictionlessly between venues."}},{title:{zh:"完成一次交易，不等于资金可以循环",en:"One completed trade is not a repeatable capital cycle"},body:{zh:"作者用跨国交易说明，低价地区买入、高价地区卖出后，所得法币可能难以汇回最初地区，资金因而被困在交易的一端。这个机制把数字资产转移与法币回流分开。编辑建议：记录价差时也记录结算币种与转移限制，不把账面价格差当作可反复实现的收益。",en:"The authors distinguish moving crypto from repatriating fiat: after buying in a low-price region and selling in a high-price region, proceeds may be difficult to return to the starting market. Capital can become trapped. Editorial application: retain settlement currencies and transfer constraints rather than treating a quoted spread as repeatedly realizable profit."},reference:{url:"https://researchonline.lse.ac.uk/id/eprint/100409/1/Cryptocurrency_Markets_JFE_final_v4.pdf",label:{zh:"接受稿引言：法币回流与市场分割",en:"Accepted manuscript introduction: fiat repatriation and segmentation"}}},{title:{zh:"把价差记录成问题，而非收益承诺",en:"Treat a spread as a question"},body:{zh:"本站建议同时记录价格、手续费、兑换与转移约束、缺失区间和数据时钟，再决定观察到的偏离是什么。本站单一Binance场所的数据只能作为局部材料，不能替代论文的跨交易所样本，更不能证明套利可执行。",en:"Record prices alongside fees, conversion and transfer constraints, missing periods and data clocks before interpreting a deviation. A single Binance venue is only partial material: it cannot replace this cross-exchange sample or establish executable arbitrage."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"接受稿与期刊定稿可能存在差异。历史价差不代表当前机会；转账、资本流动、场所风险和可成交数量均需另行评估。",en:"The accepted manuscript may differ from the journal edition. Historical deviations are not current opportunities; transfers, capital restrictions, venue risk and executable size require separate assessment."}};export{e as default};
